            "review_title": "Review at Ớt Hiểm Thai Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Михаил А.\nYekaterinburg, Russia36 contributions\n0\nVery delicious dishes and beautiful place\nJul 2026 • Couples\nRestaurant of Thai cuisine, where pleased not only the quality of dishes, but also the speed of service. They ordered Tom Yam soup, green curry shrimp, street food set and green mango octopus salad, lemonades. Cooked quickly, served beautifully, everything was delicious. Check about 1 million VDN.\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten July 22, 2026",
