            "review_title": "Review at Ớt Hiểm Thai Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Marina S\n2 contributions\n0\nI wanted to try Thai cuisine\nMay 2026 • Friends\nThe restaurant is very beautiful. The interior is beyond praise, you can take a beautiful picture, admire the fish... that's, unfortunately, it. \nThey ordered fish fried pomfred and salmon. They ruined the fish-- both were dry, tasteless. The pomfred was just deep-fried and served without vegetables. I'm not talking about the salmon at all. The fish salad wasn't tasty either. In general, I don't recommend going there. It's expensive and tasteless. The chef came out, we told him our opinion... he smiled and that was it.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten May 5, 2026",
            "rating": 1.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
