            "review_title": "Review at Ớt Hiểm Thai Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Ritesh Ail\nVietnam839 contributions\n0\nWorth a visit, good food and vibes\nOct 2025 • Friends\nThis is easily one of the best Thai restaurants in Nha Trang. The ambience is fantastic, with glamorous and visually striking interiors. Its location is extremely convenient, right on the main street, making it very accessible.\n\nThe staff are polite and attentive, which adds to the overall experience. The food exceeded our expectations. We started with Thai fish cakes, which were very well done. The Krao was excellent, and the crispy fish was absolutely fantastic. We wanted to try one of the Thai curries as well, but we were already quite full.\n\nWhile it may not be a complete substitute for authentic Thai food in Thailand, it comes very close and is definitely worth a visit.\nRead more\nWritten April 14, 2026",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
