            "review_text": "Nata_blinova\nRamenskoe, Russia80 contributions\n0\nA very beautiful, aesthetic and atmospheric restaurant!\nMar 2026 • Friends\nA very beautiful, aesthetic place in the center of Nha Trang on the first line. Beautiful interior with many details! I want to consider it while you're enjoying a delicious meal. Original serving and cozy atmosphere. It is inexpensive and can be paid by Qr code from Russian card. I recommend for aestheticians and Asian cuisine lovers, this place is a must visit!\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten March 23, 2026",
